WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.174
Read the summary: how many pictures are
ready,

2
00:00:03.174 --> 00:00:05.828
and how many need converting or can't be
used.

3
00:00:06.398 --> 00:00:09.394
When it looks right, choose Start syncing.

4
00:00:09.964 --> 00:00:14.087
Scry Sync starts sending, and its settings
window opens.

5
00:00:14.657 --> 00:00:17.320
Open the tray icon to follow along.

6
00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:22.538
When it says Up to date, every picture has
been sent.
